{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/758574-kinship-nightmare-new-werewolf-changeling-nightmare-issues","id":758574,"title":"[Kinship Nightmare] New Werewolf/Changeling Nightmare issues","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-06T06:54:28-08:00","id":758574,"title":"[Kinship Nightmare] New Werewolf/Changeling Nightmare issues","content":"I have a concept for a potential new Werewolf or Changeling Nightmare but I'm having some issues with the mechanics of it. Since the hunt is such a key component for the fear Werewolves instill in their prey and the Wild Hunt is a key source of fear within the world of Changeling I wanted to create a new Kinship power that somehow emulated that. That said, I seem to be running into an issue of duplication with other Nightmares like Run Away and They Are All Around You. Does anyone have any suggestions on how to emulate this fear without the overlap?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T07:18:54-08:00","id":758613,"title":"","content":"They Know Where You Are<br /> <br /> Targets affected by this Nightmare alerts the target's enemies enemies within a number of miles equal to the success of their presence, placing the Obsession condition on them keyed to hunting the character down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T07:50:32-08:00","id":758650,"title":"","content":"That's my point, I feel like there are already Nightmares out there that emulate this concept to a point and so I'm trying to avoid overlap. I was looking for suggestions on ways to create something new, not necessarily use the existing ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:20:58-08:00","id":758678,"title":"","content":"Arts's post was an entirely new Nightmare. I don't see anything in the book that resembles it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T08:54:07-08:00","id":758799,"title":"","content":"I think I misread it initially (I'm working from home today and have a toddler). That's an interesting concept. Perhaps the high Satiety could be adding the Frightened condition to the character themselves as they know their enemies are coming for them while spending Satiety would call a number of enemies rather than just one in a standard nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-06T09:05:39-08:00","id":758842,"title":"","content":"I actually would recommend something along the lines of the Dalu's &quot;separate from the crowd&quot; aura effect. Or a bystander effect - people targetted with this nightmare don't wnat to get involved in a fight and just watch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2